  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T08:49:34.283709Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T09:06:56.306282Z",
  "totalBlocks": 17,
  "translatedBlocks": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bc2f5a31fafa048",
      "translationZh": "我最近花了更多时间，研究那些缺乏充分文献记录的语言中的 ASR 问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "419deec692ebac1e",
      "translationZh": "拉脱维亚大学的这篇论文采用了一种非常务实的方法：为主流系统经常忽视的语言构建开源 ASR 技术栈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b3e2e3a29f97c6c",
      "translationZh": "他们构建了 LATE，这是一个轻量级工具包，可在本地或云端运行基于 Whisper 的 ASR，采用静态编译的后端（高性能、低延迟、资源占用更少且部署简单），并支持私密的本地推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e93a9fc836555fd8",
      "translationZh": "结果出乎意料地出色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5529ef49fcd3dc2c",
      "translationZh": "针对拉脱维亚语，他们使用 273.3 小时的语音对 Whisper Large V3 进行了微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e9967bb6b8c9774",
      "translationZh": "在 Common Voice 测试集上，WER 从使用 Whisper Large V3 时的 19.2% 降至 3.2%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "535fe607d134dcdf",
      "translationZh": "在他们更具挑战性的 LATE-Media 数据集上，WER 从 29.1% 降至 12.8%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4a087055751f55a",
      "translationZh": "格式化转写也有显著改善，在 Common Voice 上从 28.1% 降至 4.8%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4acfd1de865ff834",
      "translationZh": "随后，他们进一步将其拓展到拉特加尔语，这种语言的母语使用者只有约 150,000 人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a33c0576f8a779a",
      "translationZh": "他们只有 40.2 小时的训练数据，但通过从拉脱维亚语模型进行迁移学习，在 Common Voice 测试集上取得了 9.1% 的词错误率（WER）；相比之下，直接适配 Whisper Large V3 的表现要差得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "049d042f50b06666",
      "translationZh": "你并不总是需要更好的工程技术；你需要的是更好的数据、恰当的专门化，以及一个真正能部署到所需场景中的系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "026042362e45a123",
      "translationZh": "对于语音智能体，尤其是那些处理私密或特定领域对话的智能体，这是一个重要方向：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb35076362858ee4",
      "translationZh": "开放的自动语音识别（ASR）+ 本地编排 + 专门化模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e411f138cd6cb6e6",
      "translationZh": "可能远比简单地把每一句话都发送给一个庞大的托管 API 更值得关注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12e09b03abaccb49",
      "translationZh": "而且，整套方案都已开源发布，包括面向资源受限硬件的量化模型。我正在尝试使用开源的 dograh 编排，将这套方案集成到生产环境中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8318f1034d8dbbab",
      "translationZh": "附言：我是 dograh 的维护者，我们从第 0 天起就将所有内容开源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0cffc51c83d8fdea",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Slight_Republic_4242 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
